deposit.","Retain the deposit support package and document the grouped components for reviewer sign-off."}', '05574aa9-7dc8-4cbb-8e20-6399b72d0e27', NULL, 'Probable', '{B,BATCH,CUSTOMER,RECEIPT}', '{05574aa9-7dc8-4cbb-8e20-6399b72d0e27,3b1c9bac-4294-45c9-81c6-3e0235ac8ded,806c9ac0-4665-4058-ac04-d12adeca8b5e}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('1e53f6f7-0bdb-4edc-a97e-098e5a1c03f0', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', '2537c223-9ab7-4132-aa5e-2155f1811775', 'MissingFromBank', 'High', 'gl', 'seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx', 1, '2025-09-03', -450.00, 'Transaction appears in GL activity but no corresponding bank entry was identified within the permitted date and amount tolerance.', '{"reason": "No bank-side transaction remained after exact, review, and variance matching rules were applied.", "ruleId": "missing-from-bank", "evidence": ["Transaction stayed unmatched after cross-source candidate selection."], "ruleName": "Missing from Bank"}', '[]', '{"Inspect the bank statement around the transaction date for an omitted, reversed, or delayed posting.","Confirm whether the GL transaction should be voided, reclassified, or carried as an outstanding item."}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{BANK,FROM,MISSING,NORTH,VENDOR}', '{2537c223-9ab7-4132-aa5e-2155f1811775}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('242b13ab-4e3d-407a-82ce-eace1c65c75a', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', '44921fc2-6e4d-43d0-b75c-38eadfaf0e6a', 'DuplicateInGL', 'High', 'gl', 'seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx', 5, '2025-09-07', -180.00, 'GL entry appears duplicated based on same amount, date proximity, and materially similar description.', '{"reason": "Same-source duplicate detected from amount equality, close dates, and similar description or reference tokens.", "ruleId": "duplicate-detection", "evidence": ["Same amount within the configured tolerance of 0.01.", "Date proximity falls within duplicate detection window.", "Description or reference similarity indicates a duplicate posting."], "ruleName": "Duplicate Detection in GL"}', '[]', '{"Review the originating GL entries and linked source documents for duplicate posting.","Void or reverse the duplicate GL item once the correct entry is confirmed."}', NULL, NULL, 'Probable', '{CLIENT,REFUND,SIGMA}', '{44921fc2-6e4d-43d0-b75c-38eadfaf0e6a}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('3e5b271a-2fa0-4019-989f-ba3cecaffc47', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', 'f5e36e17-33b1-4061-b979-3d4f799cf262', 'FeeNettingMatch', 'High', 'gl', 'seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx', 19, '2025-10-01', 101.80, 'A bank credit matches the net of a GL revenue entry and a fee expense entry, indicating a payment processor or merchant aggregator deducted its fee before remitting. The net amount reconciles correctly; no action is required unless the gross amounts need to be restated.', '{"reason": "A bank credit matches the net of a GL revenue entry minus a fee expense, indicating a fee-netted payout.", "ruleId": "fee-netting-reserved", "evidence": ["Bank credit of 93.17 matches GL revenue 101.80 + fee -8.63 = 93.17.", "Maximum cross-source date difference is 0 day(s).", "Bank: seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx:L18; GL revenue: seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx:L19; GL fee: seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx:L20."], "ruleName": "Fee Netting Candidate", "counterpart": {"amount": 93.17, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 18, "transactionId": "f5e36e17-33b1-4061-b979-3d4f799cf262", "transactionDate": "2025-10-01", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": 93.17, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 18, "transactionId": "f5e36e17-33b1-4061-b979-3d4f799cf262", "transactionDate": "2025-10-01", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[]', '{"Confirm the gross revenue and fee amounts in GL agree with the payment processor remittance detail.","If gross amounts need to be restated, reclassify the fee to a dedicated bank charge account and record the full revenue separately."}', 'f5e36e17-33b1-4061-b979-3d4f799cf262', NULL, 'Probable', '{GROSS,PAYOUT,REVENUE,STRIPE}', '{f5e36e17-33b1-4061-b979-3d4f799cf262,9860397a-cec0-4ad6-8338-921e84c90c28,511fc005-04af-42e7-b54e-85f511843f7b}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('21a8c225-6874-4277-971a-c4a4182bcef6', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', 'f5e36e17-33b1-4061-b979-3d4f799cf262', 'FeeNettingMatch', 'High', 'gl', 'seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx', 20, '2025-10-01', -8.63, 'A bank credit matches the net of a GL revenue entry and a fee expense entry, indicating a payment processor or merchant aggregator deducted its fee before remitting. The net amount reconciles correctly; no action is required unless the gross amounts need to be restated.', '{"reason": "A bank credit matches the net of a GL revenue entry minus a fee expense, indicating a fee-netted payout.", "ruleId": "fee-netting-reserved", "evidence": ["Bank credit of 93.17 matches GL revenue 101.80 + fee -8.63 = 93.17.", "Maximum cross-source date difference is 0 day(s).", "Bank: seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx:L18; GL revenue: seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx:L19; GL fee: seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx:L20."], "ruleName": "Fee Netting Candidate", "counterpart": {"amount": 93.17, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 18, "transactionId": "f5e36e17-33b1-4061-b979-3d4f799cf262", "transactionDate": "2025-10-01", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": 93.17, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 18, "transactionId": "f5e36e17-33b1-4061-b979-3d4f799cf262", "transactionDate": "2025-10-01", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[]', '{"Confirm the gross revenue and fee amounts in GL agree with the payment processor remittance detail.","If gross amounts need to be restated, reclassify the fee to a dedicated bank charge account and record the full revenue separately."}', 'f5e36e17-33b1-4061-b979-3d4f799cf262', NULL, 'Probable', '{FEE,PROCESSING,STRIPE}', '{f5e36e17-33b1-4061-b979-3d4f799cf262,9860397a-cec0-4ad6-8338-921e84c90c28,511fc005-04af-42e7-b54e-85f511843f7b}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('3dba36f7-dada-4ffa-9899-54180efd1f62', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', 'ea1f27fc-02c4-4972-8dbd-b5a85208148e', 'PartialPaymentMatch', 'High', 'gl', 'seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx', 21, '2025-10-05', -301.50, 'Multiple bank debits together equal a single GL disbursement, indicating a single invoice was paid in installments or split across separate bank runs. Review to confirm all installments are accounted for and no partial payment remains outstanding.', '{"reason": "Multiple bank debits with similar payee context accumulate to a single GL payable, indicating partial payments.", "ruleId": "partial-payment-reserved", "evidence": ["Bank total of -301.50 across 2 payment(s) matches GL payable of -301.50.", "Average inter-bank payee similarity is 0.86.", "Maximum cross-source date difference is 4 day(s) (window: 90 days).", "Bank members: seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx:L19:-150.75; seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx:L20:-150.75.", "GL payable: seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx:L21:-301.50."], "ruleName": "Partial Payment Candidate", "counterpart": {"amount": -150.75, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 19, "transactionId": "ea1f27fc-02c4-4972-8dbd-b5a85208148e", "transactionDate": "2025-10-05", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": -150.75, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 19, "transactionId": "ea1f27fc-02c4-4972-8dbd-b5a85208148e", "transactionDate": "2025-10-05", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, {"amount": -150.75, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 20, "transactionId": "1ff8d0f6-fa3d-43eb-80bf-f6cb1d7a8a6b", "transactionDate": "2025-10-09", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[]', '{"Verify all installment bank debits are recorded in GL and that the total equals the invoice amount.","Confirm no remaining balance is outstanding on the original GL payable."}', 'ea1f27fc-02c4-4972-8dbd-b5a85208148e', NULL, 'Probable', '{992,DELTA,INSTALLMENT,INV,PLAN,VENDOR}', '{ea1f27fc-02c4-4972-8dbd-b5a85208148e,1ff8d0f6-fa3d-43eb-80bf-f6cb1d7a8a6b,27f8b3ef-f52a-46db-9a75-24ffb60e2f07}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('e185556a-2aa2-47d5-b8df-e83db782e874', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', '0537dd32-ad91-4d9e-a80b-d52abad39758', 'BankServiceChargeAmortization', 'High', 'gl', 'seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx', 24, '2025-10-15', -61.00, 'A bank service charge is split across multiple GL fee expense lines, indicating the charge was amortized or allocated across account categories. Confirm the GL allocation totals match the bank charge and that all categories are correct.', '{"reason": "A bank service charge debit matches the aggregate of multiple GL fee expense entries, indicating an amortized or split posting across account categories.", "ruleId": "bank-service-charge-reserved", "evidence": ["Bank service charge of -121.00 matches GL total of -121.00 across 2 expense line(s).", "All GL entries fall within 5 day(s) of the bank charge date.", "Service charge signal detected in bank description: \"MONTHLY SERVICE FEE ACCOUNT MAINTENANCE\"", "Bank: seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx:L22; GL lines: L24:-61.00, L25:-60.00."], "ruleName": "Bank Service Charge Candidate", "counterpart": {"amount": -121, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 22, "transactionId": "0537dd32-ad91-4d9e-a80b-d52abad39758", "transactionDate": "2025-10-15", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": -121, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 22, "transactionId": "0537dd32-ad91-4d9e-a80b-d52abad39758", "transactionDate": "2025-10-15", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[]', '{"Verify the sum of all GL fee expense lines equals the bank service charge amount.","Confirm each GL line is allocated to the correct account or cost center."}', '0537dd32-ad91-4d9e-a80b-d52abad39758', NULL, 'Probable', '{ACCOUNT,ADMIN,BANK,FEE,MAINTENANCE}', '{0537dd32-ad91-4d9e-a80b-d52abad39758,9ed02308-644d-4d4c-b4c8-131388847ce6,26e303eb-2e4c-4cbd-ac49-4955129eb71d}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('02b486d9-9e68-457b-8a48-8ab2ff95ebc6', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', '0537dd32-ad91-4d9e-a80b-d52abad39758', 'BankServiceChargeAmortization', 'High', 'gl', 'seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx', 25, '2025-10-15', -60.00, 'A bank service charge is split across multiple GL fee expense lines, indicating the charge was amortized or allocated across account categories. Confirm the GL allocation totals match the bank charge and that all categories are correct.', '{"reason": "A bank service charge debit matches the aggregate of multiple GL fee expense entries, indicating an amortized or split posting across account categories.", "ruleId": "bank-service-charge-reserved", "evidence": ["Bank service charge of -121.00 matches GL total of -121.00 across 2 expense line(s).", "All GL entries fall within 5 day(s) of the bank charge date.", "Service charge signal detected in bank description: \"MONTHLY SERVICE FEE ACCOUNT MAINTENANCE\"", "Bank: seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx:L22; GL lines: L24:-61.00, L25:-60.00."], "ruleName": "Bank Service Charge Candidate", "counterpart": {"amount": -121, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 22, "transactionId": "0537dd32-ad91-4d9e-a80b-d52abad39758", "transactionDate": "2025-10-15", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": -121, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 22, "transactionId": "0537dd32-ad91-4d9e-a80b-d52abad39758", "transactionDate": "2025-10-15", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[]', '{"Verify the sum of all GL fee expense lines equals the bank service charge amount.","Confirm each GL line is allocated to the correct account or cost center."}', '0537dd32-ad91-4d9e-a80b-d52abad39758', NULL, 'Probable', '{BANK,FEE,SERVICES,TRANSFER,WIRE}', '{0537dd32-ad91-4d9e-a80b-d52abad39758,9ed02308-644d-4d4c-b4c8-131388847ce6,26e303eb-2e4c-4cbd-ac49-4955129eb71d}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('bc44ea96-b98c-43f6-927f-521aec7c5339', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', 'c015ddfe-db71-4091-81c1-6006c2f2e8aa', 'PayrollBatchMatch', 'High', 'gl', 'seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx', 22, '2025-11-01', -3001.00, 'A single bank payroll ACH debit matches the aggregate of multiple GL individual payroll expense entries. This is expected behavior for batch payroll processing; confirm the GL entries cover all employees in the pay run.', '{"reason": "A bank payroll ACH debit matches the aggregate of multiple GL payroll expense entries posted on the same payroll date.", "ruleId": "payroll-batch-reserved", "evidence": ["Bank payroll debit of -5001.00 matches GL total of -5001.00 across 2 expense line(s).", "All GL entries fall within 5 day(s) of the bank payroll date.", "Payroll processor signal detected in bank description: \"PAYROLL DIRECT DEPOSIT BATCH\"", "Bank: seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx:L21; GL lines: L22:-3001.00, L23:-2000.00."], "ruleName": "Payroll Batch Candidate", "counterpart": {"amount": -5001, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 21, "transactionId": "c015ddfe-db71-4091-81c1-6006c2f2e8aa", "transactionDate": "2025-11-01", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": -5001, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 21, "transactionId": "c015ddfe-db71-4091-81c1-6006c2f2e8aa", "transactionDate": "2025-11-01", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[]', '{"Cross-reference the GL payroll line items against the payroll processor run report to confirm every employee is included.","If any employees are missing from GL, post the correcting entries and rerun the payroll reconciliation."}', 'c015ddfe-db71-4091-81c1-6006c2f2e8aa', NULL, 'Probable', '{A,EMPLOYEE,NOV,PAYROLL,SALARY}', '{c015ddfe-db71-4091-81c1-6006c2f2e8aa,034d5db1-dc53-4b81-9d4d-3b76f420f9b8,2fc8b5aa-0981-493b-a07b-93649aa1397c}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('742ab6c5-0d1d-489b-9aff-3a995502d8c4', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', 'c015ddfe-db71-4091-81c1-6006c2f2e8aa', 'PayrollBatchMatch', 'High', 'gl', 'seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx', 23, '2025-11-01', -2000.00, 'A single bank payroll ACH debit matches the aggregate of multiple GL individual payroll expense entries. This is expected behavior for batch payroll processing; confirm the GL entries cover all employees in the pay run.', '{"reason": "A bank payroll ACH debit matches the aggregate of multiple GL payroll expense entries posted on the same payroll date.", "ruleId": "payroll-batch-reserved", "evidence": ["Bank payroll debit of -5001.00 matches GL total of -5001.00 across 2 expense line(s).", "All GL entries fall within 5 day(s) of the bank payroll date.", "Payroll processor signal detected in bank description: \"PAYROLL DIRECT DEPOSIT BATCH\"", "Bank: seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx:L21; GL lines: L22:-3001.00, L23:-2000.00."], "ruleName": "Payroll Batch Candidate", "counterpart": {"amount": -5001, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 21, "transactionId": "c015ddfe-db71-4091-81c1-6006c2f2e8aa", "transactionDate": "2025-11-01", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": -5001, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 21, "transactionId": "c015ddfe-db71-4091-81c1-6006c2f2e8aa", "transactionDate": "2025-11-01", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[]', '{"Cross-reference the GL payroll line items against the payroll processor run report to confirm every employee is included.","If any employees are missing from GL, post the correcting entries and rerun the payroll reconciliation."}', 'c015ddfe-db71-4091-81c1-6006c2f2e8aa', NULL, 'Probable', '{B,EMPLOYEE,NOV,PAYROLL,SALARY}', '{c015ddfe-db71-4091-81c1-6006c2f2e8aa,034d5db1-dc53-4b81-9d4d-3b76f420f9b8,2fc8b5aa-0981-493b-a07b-93649aa1397c}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('ed24d9d0-dd5c-466f-8498-9e6dd3fd903d', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', 'c842bd52-8171-433c-afa8-67f0bb404fba', 'LoanPaymentSplit', 'High', 'gl', 'seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx', 26, '2025-11-10', -1000.00, 'A single bank loan payment debit corresponds to multiple GL entries recording principal reduction and interest expense for the same obligation. This is expected for amortizing loans but requires confirmation that the allocations are correct.', '{"reason": "A bank loan payment debit matches the aggregate of GL principal and interest expense entries for the same obligation.", "ruleId": "loan-payment-split-reserved", "evidence": ["Bank loan payment of -1250.00 matches GL total of -1250.00 across 2 entry(ies).", "All GL entries fall within 5 day(s) of the bank payment date.", "Loan payment signal detected in bank description: \"MORTGAGE PAYMENT WELLS FARGO\"", "Bank: seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx:L23; GL lines: L26:-1000.00, L27:-250.00."], "ruleName": "Loan Payment Split Candidate", "counterpart": {"amount": -1250, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 23, "transactionId": "c842bd52-8171-433c-afa8-67f0bb404fba", "transactionDate": "2025-11-10", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": -1250, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 23, "transactionId": "c842bd52-8171-433c-afa8-67f0bb404fba", "transactionDate": "2025-11-10", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[]', '{"Confirm that the GL principal and interest allocation matches the lender''s amortization schedule for the period.","Verify the outstanding loan balance on the balance sheet reflects the correct principal reduction."}', 'c842bd52-8171-433c-afa8-67f0bb404fba', NULL, 'Probable', '{FARGO,LOAN,MORTGAGE,PRINCIPAL,REDUCTION,WELLS}', '{c842bd52-8171-433c-afa8-67f0bb404fba,937c03b3-fffb-4a37-b900-12e577372ec2,9779e93d-e683-445e-a360-8eb6ecb9bfcb}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('ad1ddb9a-54de-4ae8-9ada-9efabb047cd3', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', 'c842bd52-8171-433c-afa8-67f0bb404fba', 'LoanPaymentSplit', 'High', 'gl', 'seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx', 27, '2025-11-10', -250.00, 'A single bank loan payment debit corresponds to multiple GL entries recording principal reduction and interest expense for the same obligation. This is expected for amortizing loans but requires confirmation that the allocations are correct.', '{"reason": "A bank loan payment debit matches the aggregate of GL principal and interest expense entries for the same obligation.", "ruleId": "loan-payment-split-reserved", "evidence": ["Bank loan payment of -1250.00 matches GL total of -1250.00 across 2 entry(ies).", "All GL entries fall within 5 day(s) of the bank payment date.", "Loan payment signal detected in bank description: \"MORTGAGE PAYMENT WELLS FARGO\"", "Bank: seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx:L23; GL lines: L26:-1000.00, L27:-250.00."], "ruleName": "Loan Payment Split Candidate", "counterpart": {"amount": -1250, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 23, "transactionId": "c842bd52-8171-433c-afa8-67f0bb404fba", "transactionDate": "2025-11-10", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": -1250, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 23, "transactionId": "c842bd52-8171-433c-afa8-67f0bb404fba", "transactionDate": "2025-11-10", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[]', '{"Confirm that the GL principal and interest allocation matches the lender''s amortization schedule for the period.","Verify the outstanding loan balance on the balance sheet reflects the correct principal reduction."}', 'c842bd52-8171-433c-afa8-67f0bb404fba', NULL, 'Probable', '{EXPENSE,FARGO,INTEREST,LOAN,MORTGAGE,WELLS}', '{c842bd52-8171-433c-afa8-67f0bb404fba,937c03b3-fffb-4a37-b900-12e577372ec2,9779e93d-e683-445e-a360-8eb6ecb9bfcb}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('30c35b40-f2f5-4ec0-9af1-b0be6f290b47', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', '662a19d6-d831-4c9e-970f-0a0b15258a89', 'CheckNumberMismatch', 'Medium', 'bank', 'seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx', 11, '2025-02-05', -1600.00, 'Transactions likely align on amount and date, but check number details do not agree and require validation.', '{"reason": "Amounts agree and narrative context appears materially related. Reference or check values differ and require reviewer validation.", "ruleId": "amount-+-date-+-text-with-reference-variance", "evidence": ["Amounts agree and narrative context appears materially related.", "Reference or check values differ and require reviewer validation."], "ruleName": "Amount + Date + Text with Reference Variance", "counterpart": {"amount": -1600, "source": "gl", "lineNumber": 13, "transactionId": "f9b8c35d-dd09-476e-b24b-57758b989e8a", "transactionDate": "2025-02-05", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": -1600, "source": "gl", "lineNumber": 13, "transactionId": "f9b8c35d-dd09-476e-b24b-57758b989e8a", "transactionDate": "2025-02-05", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[]', '{"Compare the original check support and posting details to identify which reference is correct.","Correct the reference in GL if the transaction is otherwise valid."}', 'f9b8c35d-dd09-476e-b24b-57758b989e8a', NULL, 'Probable', '{2150,CHECK,FEB,LANDLORD,RENT}', '{662a19d6-d831-4c9e-970f-0a0b15258a89,f9b8c35d-dd09-476e-b24b-57758b989e8a}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('77f984ec-d866-401f-b692-a9db681ff488', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', '84428a67-6507-4595-bafd-d06445106b3e', 'ReferenceNumberMismatch', 'Medium', 'bank', 'seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx', 12, '2025-02-12', -450.00, 'Transactions likely align on amount and date, but reference number details do not agree and require validation.', '{"reason": "Amounts agree and narrative context appears materially related. Reference or check values differ and require reviewer validation.", "ruleId": "amount-+-date-+-text-with-reference-variance", "evidence": ["Amounts agree and narrative context appears materially related.", "Reference or check values differ and require reviewer validation."], "ruleName": "Amount + Date + Text with Reference Variance", "counterpart": {"amount": -450, "source": "gl", "lineNumber": 14, "transactionId": "cd74e18d-9af6-4b98-8bf5-d369f301a281", "transactionDate": "2025-02-12", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": -450, "source": "gl", "lineNumber": 14, "transactionId": "cd74e18d-9af6-4b98-8bf5-d369f301a281", "transactionDate": "2025-02-12", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[]', '{"Review supporting documents to determine whether the reference difference is clerical or substantive.","Correct the stored reference value if the transaction is otherwise valid."}', 'cd74e18d-9af6-4b98-8bf5-d369f301a281', NULL, 'Probable', '{7788,CLIENT,REF,SETTLEMENT,WIRE}', '{84428a67-6507-4595-bafd-d06445106b3e,cd74e18d-9af6-4b98-8bf5-d369f301a281}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('78dd6083-76a8-4c61-bb0e-bed7d91950d9', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', '35f56ac5-6f60-4ba9-bcd1-4054fecc77ed', 'DateVariance', 'Medium', 'bank', 'seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx', 9, '2025-04-01', 3200.00, 'Transactions likely relate to the same activity, but the recorded dates differ beyond the primary tolerance and should be validated.', '{"reason": "Amounts agree within the configured tolerance of 0.01. Date variance remains outside the primary tolerance but inside the extended review window.", "ruleId": "amount-+-extended-date-window-match", "evidence": ["Amounts agree within the configured tolerance of 0.01.", "Date variance remains outside the primary tolerance but inside the extended review window."], "ruleName": "Amount + Extended Date Window Match", "counterpart": {"amount": 3200, "source": "gl", "lineNumber": 11, "transactionId": "bede6d49-42a6-478c-8e61-e7279ced3398", "transactionDate": "2025-04-15", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": 3200, "source": "gl", "lineNumber": 11, "transactionId": "bede6d49-42a6-478c-8e61-e7279ced3398", "transactionDate": "2025-04-15", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[]', '{"Verify whether the date difference is an acceptable posting lag or a cut-off issue.","Retain support for the timing if no correction is required."}', 'bede6d49-42a6-478c-8e61-e7279ced3398', NULL, 'DateVariance', '{BATCH,CLIENT,DEPOSIT}', '{35f56ac5-6f60-4ba9-bcd1-4054fecc77ed,bede6d49-42a6-478c-8e61-e7279ced3398}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('cefd17ce-5447-49f8-9f8c-6ef2383a93c9', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', '2393a08f-415c-4c09-8325-fda8fae80b7c', 'TimingDifference', 'Medium', 'bank', 'seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx', 10, '2025-04-29', -2400.00, 'Transaction likely represents a timing difference between book entry and bank posting rather than a recording error.', '{"reason": "A same-amount, timing-compatible GL transaction remains unmatched within the extended timing window.", "ruleId": "residual-timing-difference", "evidence": ["Same-amount residual transactions remained unmatched after exact and review matching.", "Date difference is 19 day(s), which is outside the primary tolerance and within the timing-difference window.", "Narrative similarity score is 1.00 and reference similarity score is 0.00.", "Transaction kinds remain timing-compatible: bank=withdrawal, gl=withdrawal."], "ruleName": "Residual Timing Difference", "counterpart": {"amount": -2400, "source": "gl", "lineNumber": 12, "transactionId": "a9446e12-21ec-4742-aa83-e5074c18ca94", "transactionDate": "2025-05-18", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": -2400, "source": "gl", "lineNumber": 12, "transactionId": "a9446e12-21ec-4742-aa83-e5074c18ca94", "transactionDate": "2025-05-18", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[{"reason": "Amounts agree within the configured tolerance of 0.01. Date variance remains outside the primary tolerance but inside the extended review window.", "ruleId": "amount-+-extended-date-window-match", "evidence": ["Amounts agree within the configured tolerance of 0.01.", "Date variance remains outside the primary tolerance but inside the extended review window."], "ruleName": "Amount + Extended Date Window Match", "counterpart": {"amount": -2400, "source": "gl", "lineNumber": 12, "transactionId": "a9446e12-21ec-4742-aa83-e5074c18ca94", "transactionDate": "2025-05-18", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": -2400, "source": "gl", "lineNumber": 12, "transactionId": "a9446e12-21ec-4742-aa83-e5074c18ca94", "transactionDate": "2025-05-18", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}]', '{"Confirm the item represents a valid clearing or posting delay between book and bank timing.","Carry the item as timing support and monitor it in the next reconciliation cycle."}', 'a9446e12-21ec-4742-aa83-e5074c18ca94', NULL, 'TimingDifference', '{APRIL,BATCH,PAYROLL,PROCESSOR}', '{2393a08f-415c-4c09-8325-fda8fae80b7c,a9446e12-21ec-4742-aa83-e5074c18ca94}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('38801740-9972-4c63-b5b9-8ae76e87098f', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', 'a6076ffc-ee2b-48f9-af2e-db68dd3f4151', 'WeakDescriptionMatch', 'Medium', 'bank', 'seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx', 14, '2025-06-04', -812.40, 'Amount and date align within configured tolerance, but description or payee text shares little to no vocabulary between sources. The match relies on amount and date alone and should be reviewed before treating it as confirmed.', '{"reason": "Amounts agree within the configured tolerance of 0.01 and dates fall within the primary tolerance window. Description or payee text shares little vocabulary between sources (best similarity 38%), but this amount occurs at most 1 time(s) on each side, making amount and date alone a trustworthy signal. Reviewer confirmation is required before treating this as a confirmed match.", "ruleId": "amount-+-date-match,-weak-description", "evidence": ["Amounts agree within the configured tolerance of 0.01 and dates fall within the primary tolerance window.", "Description or payee text shares little vocabulary between sources (best similarity 38%), but this amount occurs at most 1 time(s) on each side, making amount and date alone a trustworthy signal.", "Reviewer confirmation is required before treating this as a confirmed match."], "ruleName": "Amount + Date Match, Weak Description", "counterpart": {"amount": -812.4, "source": "gl", "lineNumber": 16, "transactionId": "476b4736-e53a-4427-aaef-480bd38936d2", "transactionDate": "2025-06-04", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": -812.4, "source": "gl", "lineNumber": 16, "transactionId": "476b4736-e53a-4427-aaef-480bd38936d2", "transactionDate": "2025-06-04", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[]', '{"Confirm the counterpart relationship using source support, since description text alone could not corroborate it.","Add reviewer notes before approving; consider updating GL memo conventions if this pattern recurs often."}', '476b4736-e53a-4427-aaef-480bd38936d2', NULL, 'Probable', '{5512340,BLUEPRINT,CORP,CUSTOMER,DEBIT,ID,ITS,LOGISTICS,NEVADA,NV,PYMT,TAX,TX}', '{a6076ffc-ee2b-48f9-af2e-db68dd3f4151,476b4736-e53a-4427-aaef-480bd38936d2}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('cc41ffb3-b2db-4486-8d31-446125308d0d', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', '9dc6d95c-f895-45ae-a368-24f363af21a1', 'AmbiguousMatchRequiringReview', 'Medium', 'bank', 'seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx', 26, '2025-06-10', -85.00, 'Multiple plausible counterparts were identified and the system will not force a weak match without reviewer confirmation.', '{"reason": "Amounts align and dates are close, but description or merchant context still needs review. Reviewer confirmation is required before the match can be treated as exact.", "ruleId": "amount-+-date-with-description-variance", "evidence": ["Amounts align and dates are close, but description or merchant context still needs review.", "Reviewer confirmation is required before the match can be treated as exact."], "ruleName": "Amount + Date with Description Variance", "counterpart": {"amount": -85, "source": "gl", "lineNumber": 28, "transactionId": "ff2bc2ac-887a-41fb-873c-79fff9f87f94", "transactionDate": "2025-06-15", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": -85, "source": "gl", "lineNumber": 28, "transactionId": "ff2bc2ac-887a-41fb-873c-79fff9f87f94", "transactionDate": "2025-06-15", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[]', '{"Compare the candidate counterparts manually and select the correct match before sign-off.","Document the reviewer decision so the final reconciliation trail is explicit."}', 'ff2bc2ac-887a-41fb-873c-79fff9f87f94', NULL, 'Probable', '{CARD,FUEL,SHELL}', '{9dc6d95c-f895-45ae-a368-24f363af21a1,ff2bc2ac-887a-41fb-873c-79fff9f87f94}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('595edec7-bfec-45a5-94fd-6cebf3de63fe', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', '04e2c920-ddb1-4629-b197-606683f984a7', 'ReversalVoid', 'Medium', 'bank', 'seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx', 27, '2025-10-01', -500.00, 'Bank records show a matched debit and credit that net to zero, indicating a reversal or void. Confirm whether a corresponding GL void entry exists.', '{"reason": "A bank debit and credit of the same amount within the reversal window indicate a reversal or void.", "ruleId": "reversal-void", "evidence": ["Bank debit and credit of 500.00 net to zero, indicating a reversal or void.", "Date difference is 1 day(s).", "Narrative similarity score is 0.75."], "ruleName": "Reversal / Void Pair", "counterpart": {"amount": 500, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 28, "transactionId": "b169563b-7cf7-48f0-85d7-2215b0388d24", "transactionDate": "2025-10-02", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": 500, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 28, "transactionId": "b169563b-7cf7-48f0-85d7-2215b0388d24", "transactionDate": "2025-10-02", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[]', '{"Confirm whether a GL void or reversal entry was posted for the matched bank pair.","If no GL entry exists, post a reversing journal entry and document the bank-side resolution."}', 'b169563b-7cf7-48f0-85d7-2215b0388d24', NULL, 'Probable', '{BANK,DEBIT,ENTRY,JOURNAL}', '{04e2c920-ddb1-4629-b197-606683f984a7,b169563b-7cf7-48f0-85d7-2215b0388d24}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('cc1195cd-7d82-4717-a45c-e64cd4a56002', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', '04e2c920-ddb1-4629-b197-606683f984a7', 'ReversalVoid', 'Medium', 'bank', 'seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx', 28, '2025-10-02', 500.00, 'Bank records show a matched debit and credit that net to zero, indicating a reversal or void. Confirm whether a corresponding GL void entry exists.', '{"reason": "A bank debit and credit of the same amount within the reversal window indicate a reversal or void.", "ruleId": "reversal-void", "evidence": ["Bank debit and credit of 500.00 net to zero, indicating a reversal or void.", "Date difference is 1 day(s).", "Narrative similarity score is 0.75."], "ruleName": "Reversal / Void Pair", "counterpart": {"amount": -500, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 27, "transactionId": "04e2c920-ddb1-4629-b197-606683f984a7", "transactionDate": "2025-10-01", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": -500, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 27, "transactionId": "04e2c920-ddb1-4629-b197-606683f984a7", "transactionDate": "2025-10-01", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[]', '{"Confirm whether a GL void or reversal entry was posted for the matched bank pair.","If no GL entry exists, post a reversing journal entry and document the bank-side resolution."}', '04e2c920-ddb1-4629-b197-606683f984a7', NULL, 'Probable', '{BANK,CREDIT,ENTRY,JOURNAL}', '{04e2c920-ddb1-4629-b197-606683f984a7,b169563b-7cf7-48f0-85d7-2215b0388d24}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('ea8a3e86-6123-4493-a542-3edbe8b88549', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', '08337bbb-158e-4c4d-8dd4-7bd0017e10e2', 'StaleOutstandingCheck', 'Medium', 'gl', 'seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx', 17, '2025-02-10', -150.00, 'A GL check or check-like disbursement remains unmatched in bank activity past the stale-date threshold and should be investigated for voiding, reissue, or clearance status.', '{"reason": "GL check-like disbursement remains unmatched in bank activity 278 days after its recorded date.", "ruleId": "stale-outstanding-check", "evidence": ["Transaction remains unmatched on the bank side after matching completed.", "Recorded age relative to the latest statement activity is 278 days.", "Transaction type indicates a check-like disbursement."], "ruleName": "Stale Outstanding Check"}', '[]', '{"Determine whether the check should be voided, reissued, or left outstanding based on current status.","Update the books and reconciliation support for stale-dated check treatment."}', NULL, NULL, 'Unmatched', '{A,CHECK,UNCLEARED,VENDOR}', '{08337bbb-158e-4c4d-8dd4-7bd0017e10e2}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', 278) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('e05b100c-3cdd-4a50-a7a9-1a08d6158932', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', '2393a08f-415c-4c09-8325-fda8fae80b7c', 'TimingDifference', 'Medium', 'gl', 'seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx', 12, '2025-05-18', -2400.00, 'Transaction likely represents a timing difference between book entry and bank posting rather than a recording error.', '{"reason": "A same-amount, timing-compatible bank transaction remains unmatched within the extended timing window.", "ruleId": "residual-timing-difference", "evidence": ["Same-amount residual transactions remained unmatched after exact and review matching.", "Date difference is 19 day(s), which is outside the primary tolerance and within the timing-difference window.", "Narrative similarity score is 1.00 and reference similarity score is 0.00.", "Transaction kinds remain timing-compatible: bank=withdrawal, gl=withdrawal."], "ruleName": "Residual Timing Difference", "counterpart": {"amount": -2400, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 10, "transactionId": "2393a08f-415c-4c09-8325-fda8fae80b7c", "transactionDate": "2025-04-29", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": -2400, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 10, "transactionId": "2393a08f-415c-4c09-8325-fda8fae80b7c", "transactionDate": "2025-04-29", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[{"reason": "Amounts agree within the configured tolerance of 0.01. Date variance remains outside the primary tolerance but inside the extended review window.", "ruleId": "amount-+-extended-date-window-match", "evidence": ["Amounts agree within the configured tolerance of 0.01.", "Date variance remains outside the primary tolerance but inside the extended review window."], "ruleName": "Amount + Extended Date Window Match", "counterpart": {"amount": -2400, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 10, "transactionId": "2393a08f-415c-4c09-8325-fda8fae80b7c", "transactionDate": "2025-04-29", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": -2400, "source": "bank", "lineNumber": 10, "transactionId": "2393a08f-415c-4c09-8325-fda8fae80b7c", "transactionDate": "2025-04-29", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}]', '{"Confirm the item represents a valid clearing or posting delay between book and bank timing.","Carry the item as timing support and monitor it in the next reconciliation cycle."}', '2393a08f-415c-4c09-8325-fda8fae80b7c', NULL, 'TimingDifference', '{APRIL,BATCH,PAYROLL,PROCESSOR}', '{2393a08f-415c-4c09-8325-fda8fae80b7c,a9446e12-21ec-4742-aa83-e5074c18ca94}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('761e7956-f0cb-4c1e-b671-3c7821350dc1', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', '6e526170-a3f3-46c1-812e-8b270d9693e0', 'DescriptionMerchantVariance', 'Low', 'bank', 'seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx', 13, '2025-02-18', -245.00, 'Transactions appear related but contain materially different merchant, payee, or description wording and should be reviewed.', '{"reason": "Amounts align and dates are close, but description or merchant context still needs review. Reviewer confirmation is required before the match can be treated as exact.", "ruleId": "amount-+-date-with-description-variance", "evidence": ["Amounts align and dates are close, but description or merchant context still needs review.", "Reviewer confirmation is required before the match can be treated as exact."], "ruleName": "Amount + Date with Description Variance", "counterpart": {"amount": -245, "source": "gl", "lineNumber": 15, "transactionId": "3b16fefd-ab0f-47ac-a59f-57eba560bdb2", "transactionDate": "2025-02-18", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx"}, "counterparts": [{"amount": -245, "source": "gl", "lineNumber": 15, "transactionId": "3b16fefd-ab0f-47ac-a59f-57eba560bdb2", "transactionDate": "2025-02-18", "spreadsheetFileName": "seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx"}]}', '[]', '{"Review merchant, payee, and memo fields against source support to verify the counterpart relationship.","Add reviewer notes before approving or rejecting the proposed relationship."}', '3b16fefd-ab0f-47ac-a59f-57eba560bdb2', NULL, 'Probable', '{DEPOT,MONTHLY,OFFICE,RUN}', '{6e526170-a3f3-46c1-812e-8b270d9693e0,3b16fefd-ab0f-47ac-a59f-57eba560bdb2}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('b45289ee-52ca-40c3-bd5a-931789fc84e0', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', '82349bd2-315e-4e4a-8e36-d3afc4d9e3ca', 'InterestIncome', 'Low', 'bank', 'seed-bank-all-exceptions.xlsx', 34, '2025-09-30', 12.50, 'A bank interest credit has no corresponding GL entry. Interest income earned during the period should be recorded to the appropriate income account.', '{"reason": "A bank interest credit has no corresponding GL entry. Interest income earned during the period should be recorded.", "ruleId": "interest-income", "evidence": ["Bank credit of 12.50 contains interest income keywords.", "No matching GL income entry was found within the configured date and amount tolerance.", "Record the interest credit to the appropriate GL income account."], "ruleName": "Interest Income"}', '[]', '{"Record the interest income in GL to the appropriate interest income account.","Confirm the amount matches the bank statement interest credit and attach the source detail."}', NULL, NULL, 'Unmatched', '{EARNED,INTEREST,SAVINGS}', '{82349bd2-315e-4e4a-8e36-d3afc4d9e3ca}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('d340c147-5ef3-49a9-8b4b-adca4033b618', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', 'c42b007d-65a6-45b6-a959-f3caf9143735', 'OutstandingCheck', 'Low', 'gl', 'seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx', 18, '2025-11-07', -273.50, 'A GL check or check-like disbursement has not yet cleared the bank within the current statement period. This is a normal reconciling item; carry it forward and confirm clearance in the next cycle.', '{"reason": "GL check-like disbursement has not cleared the bank 8 day(s) after its recorded date, within the normal clearing window.", "ruleId": "outstanding-check", "evidence": ["Transaction remains unmatched on the bank side after matching completed.", "Recorded age relative to the latest statement activity is 8 day(s), within the 45-day stale threshold.", "Transaction type indicates a check-like disbursement.", "Carry as an outstanding item and confirm clearance in the next reconciliation cycle."], "ruleName": "Outstanding Check"}', '[]', '{"Verify the check has not been lost, stopped, or returned.","Carry as an outstanding item on the reconciliation support schedule and confirm clearance in the next cycle."}', NULL, NULL, 'Unmatched', '{B,CHECK,NORMAL,UNCLEARED,VENDOR}', '{c42b007d-65a6-45b6-a959-f3caf9143735}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', 8) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.reconciliation_exception (id, job_id, canonical_row_id, category, severity, source_system, spreadsheet_file_name, line_number, transaction_date, amount, error_message, rule_trace_json, prior_rule_traces_json, recommended_next_actions, likely_matching_reference, reviewer_notes, match_confidence, normalized_comparison_tokens, related_transaction_ids, created_at, organization_id, age_in_days) VALUES ('d87c2409-4455-44ab-8a9a-a49122dd1151', 'ef87469e-28a3-4e88-9cb8-5cb62cace7d3', 'd85d488e-91a7-446e-b37d-cb30099fc7a0', 'DepositInTransit', 'Low', 'gl', 'seed-gl-all-exceptions.xlsx', 30, '2025-11-12', 250.00, 'A GL deposit is recorded near the statement period end with no corresponding bank entry, consistent with a deposit in transit that will clear in the next cycle.', '{"reason": "A GL credit recorded near the statement period end has no corresponding bank entry, consistent with a deposit in transit.", "ruleId": "deposit-in-transit", "evidence": ["Transaction is a GL credit with no matching bank entry.", "Transaction date is within 7 day(s) of the reconciliation anchor date.", "Transaction is not check-like."], "ruleName": "Deposit in Transit"}', '[]', '{"Confirm the deposit clears in the bank statement for the next reconciliation period.","Carry forward as a deposit-in-transit on the reconciliation support schedule."}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{CLIENT,DEPOSIT,IN,REMOTE,TRANSIT}', '{d85d488e-91a7-446e-b37d-cb30099fc7a0}', '2026-09-04 12:27:08.203274+00', :'seed_org_id', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;


